1	//! The budgeted content-addressed chunk cache — the local-footprint dial.
2	//!
3	//! Blobs live as files under the cache dir, named by their sha-256 hex;
4	//! metadata (size, recency, pin) lives in a sqlite table beside them. Reads
5	//! verify the bytes against the address before serving — a corrupt entry is
6	//! deleted and treated as a miss (fail-safe, never fail-open). Recency is a
7	//! monotonic access counter, not wall-clock, so LRU order is deterministic
8	//! and testable.
9	//!
10	//! The cache is always an optimization: a miss costs a (metered) server
11	//! fetch, never correctness. Eviction policy is LRU over unpinned entries;
12	//! the pin *mechanism* ships here, richer pin policies arrive with M3+.
